{"2821110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Subversive Memories", "steam_appid": 2821110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/6995cdc21888731d59b2d5fc8c6e8357.avif?t=1782335260\" width=750 height=172 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renata has been haunted her entire life by a void within. She needs to find answers that fill the gaps of her past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She follows a promising track to an abandoned military research base. However, she soon finds out that this place holds secrets beyond her comprehension and that her obsession might cost her a price she can't pay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.poster.avif?t=1782335260\" width=608 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.webm?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.mp4?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by many true stories from the Brazilian military dictatorship period (1964–1985), Subversive Memories delves into a dense narrative about oppression, memory, and the scars left by a ruthless regime that kidnapped, censored, and killed thousands of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game itself is heavily inspired by classic survival-horror games from the late 90s, employing retro 3d graphics, limited resources and an involving mystery that respects the players ability to put all the pieces together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.poster.avif?t=1782335260\" width=608 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.webm?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.mp4?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maze-like areas trying to find the answers you seek.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself and engage in combat only when necessary.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources to survive each area and unfold the secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items to solve puzzles and progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target of 2-3 hours of gameplay with replayability in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative endings that reward dedicated players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/6995cdc21888731d59b2d5fc8c6e8357.avif?t=1782335260\" width=750 height=172 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renata has been haunted her entire life by a void within. She needs to find answers that fill the gaps of her past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She follows a promising track to an abandoned military research base. However, she soon finds out that this place holds secrets beyond her comprehension and that her obsession might cost her a price she can't pay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.poster.avif?t=1782335260\" width=608 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.webm?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/a321776d17cc035bd4c39f584ec80a07.mp4?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by many true stories from the Brazilian military dictatorship period (1964–1985), Subversive Memories delves into a dense narrative about oppression, memory, and the scars left by a ruthless regime that kidnapped, censored, and killed thousands of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game itself is heavily inspired by classic survival-horror games from the late 90s, employing retro 3d graphics, limited resources and an involving mystery that respects the players ability to put all the pieces together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.poster.avif?t=1782335260\" width=608 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.webm?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/extras/f7a50d5b24ad2dcb64f8ee12bcefe96d.mp4?t=1782335260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maze-like areas trying to find the answers you seek.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself and engage in combat only when necessary.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources to survive each area and unfold the secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items to solve puzzles and progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target of 2-3 hours of gameplay with replayability in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative endings that reward dedicated players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Subversive Memories is a story driven survival horror set in Brazil during the last military dictatorship. Explore the backrooms of an oppressive regime, escape ominous presences and scavenge every corner of this land in search of your ██████.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/ea837a0a57794493099170bc4316afdbbd34c364/header.jpg?t=1782335260", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821110/6f36ee9b03de73f59e1148bf18e738276c8fad93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782335260", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap